What Browser Receives ??

->Browser DOES NOT receive session data.
->it receive only cookies (Session ID + Signature)


let's suppoase 
secret = "mysecretkey"
sessionId = "abc123"

Server internally creates signature:

signature = hash(sessionId + secret)

Now server sends sessionId and signature to browser as cookies:
Set-Cookie: sessionId=abc123; HttpOnly; Secure
Set-Cookie: signature=x7Adk91; HttpOnly; Secure



When browser makes subsequent requests, it sends these cookies back to the server:
Cookie: sessionId=abc123; signature=x7Adk91
Server receives the sessionId and signature, then it verifies the signature using the secret key:
expectedSignature = hash(sessionId + secret)
if (signature === expectedSignature) {
    // Signature is valid, retrieve session data using sessionId
    sessionData = getSessionData(sessionId)
}
